Initial commit: SecureDrop — secure browser-to-browser temporary workspace

- Server: Express + Socket.IO signaling, node:sqlite persistence,
  Zero-Trust auth middleware, rate limiting, background session
  expiry/inactivity sweep
- Client: React + Vite, WebCrypto ECDH/AES-GCM E2E encryption,
  WebRTC DataChannel file/note/clipboard transfer, QR + code pairing
- Docs: README.md (run/deploy) and ARCHITECTURE.md (security design)
